        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "9068fd58-5feb-5b6e-8838-834e512bcb70",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Richard Schiff, David Shore, Daniel Dae Kim, Yunjin Kim\n- TV Series: The Good Doctor, Lost, The Whole Truth\n- Companies: ABC, 3AD\n- Roles: Dr. Glassman, Sun Kwon, Jin Kwon\n- Places: San José, California, South Korea\n\nFacts:\n- In 2013, the South Korean series The Good Doctor was released, and the American series The Good Doctor is based on it.\n- The American medical-drama television series The Good Doctor was developed by David Shore.\n- ABC's prime-time drama series The Good Doctor features Richard Schiff in a leading role as Dr. Glassman, the president of a fictional teaching hospital in San José, California, beginning in September 2017.\n- Daniel Dae Kim runs the film and television production company 3AD, which is producing the television series The Good Doctor.\n- In the Lost episode The Whole Truth, flashbacks feature Sun Kwon, played by Yunjin Kim, and revolve around her and Jin Kwon, played by Daniel Dae Kim, and their fertility problems.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
